            "review_title": "Review at Che Thai Y Phuong",
            "review_text": "Tony V\nMelbourne, Australia11 contributions\n0\nAmazing che thai\nAug 2015 • Couples\nThis place is slightly out of the city , however it is well worth the trip. It looks a little dodgy and dirty but the che thai is great. My girlfriend is addicted to it, we ate it every day while in Saigon. It is always very busy at night, however the service is fast and efficient and it is very cheap (23k for a che thai). It is full of locals but don't be afraid. Excellent way to end the day.\nRead more\nWritten August 10, 2015",
